<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - InPhyNet started as a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - InPhyNet started as a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of InPhyNet Medical Management Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Also, Dillon Read initiated coverage of the company with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $26 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the physician practice management company gained one to 18-3/4 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
